# dinput8.chain - DLLs the kotor-coop loader (installed as dinput8.dll) loads, in order.
#
# Copy this to the game directory as "dinput8.chain" (install.ps1 -Chain writes one for
# you). One path per line, relative to the game directory; # and ; start a comment.
#
# The FIRST entry that exports DirectInput8Create receives the game's DirectInput calls.
# The kotor-coop plugin forwards them to the entry after itself, then to the system
# dinput8.dll, so a second proxy (ReShade, a widescreen fix...) belongs AFTER the plugin.
# A DLL that just needs to be loaded (ASI-style) can go anywhere.

KotorCoop.Plugin.dll
# dinput8.prev.dll        # another mod's dinput8.dll, renamed
# ReShade32.dll
# some-mod.asi
